["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"42.【汽車史話02】集權者福特與全球第二暢銷T型車的衰落 vertical integration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-18-zhangxiaojun-t型车曾占全球市场一半-却因19年不换代被通用取代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70e535c84a96bcfc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">50:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>T型車曾佔全球市場一半，卻因19年不換代被通用取代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福特靠一款車讓普通人買得起汽車，T型車一度佔據全球汽車銷量的一半以上；但正因為它只有一個品種、一個顏色、十九年不換代，消費者沒有換車的理由，市場被通用拿走。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車史</span><span class=\"tag\">福特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"41.【汽車史話01】世界上第一輛燃油車、女車手和慈禧太后 Red Flag Act Otto cycle Whiz Kids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-15-zhangxiaojun-汽车只是马车上加个发动机-马车公司却一家没活下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e3a530c55a91b164-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">51:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>汽車只是馬車上加個發動機，馬車公司卻一家沒活下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">汽車不是馬車上加一臺發動機那麼簡單：動力總成換了，整個技術棧和市場跟著換，當年造車廂的馬車公司沒有一家活過百年。今天衡量電動車企，看的是它能不能掌控上游的電池。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車史</span><span class=\"tag\">內燃機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"40. 和美國科技界人士聊硅谷AI的冷與熱：第二波浪潮拉開帷幕 Copilot RPA magnificent seven red team self regulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-09-27-zhangxiaojun-模型不是护城河-硅谷ai第二波-钱开始往硬件转/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a40331d0b703b13e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>模型不是護城河：硅谷AI第二波，錢開始往硬件轉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硅谷已經形成共識：模型本身不是產品也不是護城河，值錢的是模型之上的 use case。同時 GPU 短缺把投資方向從軟件推向硬件，大公司戰投比純 VC 更早入場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷AI</span><span class=\"tag\">模型護城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"38. 和軟銀願景原GP聊聊，大模型全球降溫後，人工智能何去何從 Foundation Model society of minds EV/EBITDA bottom-up\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-20-zhangxiaojun-大模型降温不是坏事-是几十年的技术大周期才刚起步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aff773d4596719b4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>大模型降溫不是壞事，是幾十年的技術大週期才剛起步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">語言大模型只是機器在反芻人類已經消化過的知識，真正的機器智能會直接從世界觀察學習；降溫後堅持做事的人才能走到最後。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">技術週期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"37. 小冰李笛講點真心話：只做大模型不追求商業模式是很難生存的 API 思維鏈 混合模型 數字員工\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-16-zhangxiaojun-把自己定义成大模型公司-是一个都活不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e116190fb0ec101f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>把自己定義成大模型公司，是一個都活不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李笛說大模型公司不是10個死9個，而是界定成大模型公司就一個都活不了——因為創造的價值和收到的錢是兩回事，API 定價貼著成本走，利潤上限只有每千 token 0.2 美分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型商業模式</span><span class=\"tag\">小冰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"36.【做個生意吧！】跳向後海的年輕人、酒精和下沉年代 MVP SOP social ladder\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-13-zhangxiaojun-跳海不投营销-一个人站进吧台-店外就多20个客人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0765e6dc8bc37b76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>跳海不投營銷：一個人站進吧檯，店外就多20個客人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">跳海從不花錢投小紅書和抖音，它的增長引擎是打酒師：請熟客和朋友來站吧檯，一個人站進去，他外面的朋友就會來，店外就多20個人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">社群運營</span><span class=\"tag\">線下連鎖</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"35. 200位GP趕去中東募資？聊聊沙漠上的白袍、主權基金和金錢王國 LP GP family office carry ADQ ADIA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-07-zhangxiaojun-中东主权基金不投小项目-中国gp第一次拿钱要等18个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6e25de1254344a81-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>中東主權基金不投小項目，中國GP第一次拿錢要等18個月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中東資本是啞鈴型結構：主權基金和family office兩頭大、中間空。主權基金越來越直投化，要的是反投和產業落地，不是財務回報。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東</span><span class=\"tag\">主權基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"34. 被忽視的中腰部公司活得還好嗎？他們的慾望、掙扎與天命 Permanent Head Damage BAU cut off\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-31-zhangxiaojun-中腰部公司不是小公司-是二级赛道里被忽视的王者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ab22b27de95a023-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>中腰部公司不是小公司，是二級賽道里被忽視的王者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它們大多是一個千億級二級賽道里的第一或第二名，創始人從不甘心只做中腰部，但賽道出身極大程度上決定了它們的天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中腰部公司</span><span class=\"tag\">二級賽道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"33.【職場人性】企業內鬥，究竟在鬥什麼？ Silo OGSM integrity organizational awareness resourceful\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-19-zhangxiaojun-内斗是显性的-内耗才是组织的慢性自杀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82ee0734b369d003-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0719</span></div>\n<h2>內鬥是顯性的，內耗才是組織的慢性自殺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">內鬥看得見、還能吃瓜，內耗看不見、卻被當成制度流程本身；真正拖垮公司的不是誰跟誰鬥，而是資源冗餘、方向缺失下人人追求存在感。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span><span class=\"tag\">職場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"32. 第一個把查理·芒格引入中國的人和出版風雲 咖啡書 馬爾薩斯陷阱 雙軌分析 系統一\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-10-zhangxiaojun-把芒格引入中国的人-出版黄金十年已经落幕/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f1e5f8dcbbb78e3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>把芒格引入中國的人：出版黃金十年已經落幕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出版業沒有定價權，京東把圖書當引流品虧著賣，行業幾百億規模在它眼裡只是廣告費。施宏俊說出版會變成邊緣行業，但也會變得更「高貴」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出版</span><span class=\"tag\">芒格</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"31.【趨勢2023】和老範從退潮的內容投資談起 carry BP MR NFT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-03-zhangxiaojun-投资人不再投纯内容-因为内容是马鞍不是千里马/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9608565a6d569392-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0703</span></div>\n<h2>投資人不再投純內容，因為內容是馬鞍不是千里馬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">內容公司成功率遠高於絕大多數生意，但天花板由產業特質決定：百花齊放意味著集中度低。所以投資人把內容當鞭子，去找能騎的千里馬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容投資</span><span class=\"tag\">播客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"29. 逆全球化思潮來勢洶洶，外企CEO何故密集訪華？ CDR 紅籌架構 FDI 國際版\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-12-zhangxiaojun-外企ceo密集访华-逆全球化是政治问题-不是经济问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb0b83ff98bdb00e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">50:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>外企CEO密集訪華：逆全球化是政治問題，不是經濟問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">逆全球化來勢洶洶卻擋不住CEO們排隊來華，因為脫鉤違反經濟規律；但真正推動脫鉤的不是經濟邏輯，而是老大防老二的政治邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">外資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"27. 英文播客：和深度學習奠基人聊聊大腦、模型和人類的愛 Boltzmann machine self-supervision basal ganglia hippocampus stochastic parrots\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-02-zhangxiaojun-ai-只是刚离地的莱特飞机-我们还不会控制它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b12b964120eb5ab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0602</span></div>\n<h2>AI 只是剛離地的萊特飛機，我們還不會控制它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">深度學習奠基人謝諾夫斯基說，大模型缺的不是語言而是基底核——沒有價值函數、沒有長期記憶、沒有情緒，而這些腦區都能補上；真正的風險不是規模，而是沒人知道它會長出什麼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">深度學習</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"26. 令德國人驚嚇的上海車展：一幅當代汽車眾生圖 just in time OTA For China For China\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-23-zhangxiaojun-车展最热闹的一年-也是合资品牌最危险的一年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec1dcb3e2905617e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>車展最熱鬧的一年，也是合資品牌最危險的一年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國品牌市佔率會很快提高，合資品牌若不能給合資公司帶來價值，就可能變成獨資品牌——這是車展熱鬧背後真正的洗牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車</span><span class=\"tag\">上海車展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"25. OpenAI開源、亞馬遜新動作，全球大模型格局走向何方 vertical copilot LLM transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-16-zhangxiaojun-大模型底层战争已结束-垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ffbd8664f0cee8a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>大模型底層戰爭已結束，垂直副駕駛才是老炮的機會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">底層大模型是年輕人借微軟算力做出的湧現，但真正賺錢的行業副駕駛屬於創業老兵——三分之二的垂直機會已被ChatGPT自己幹掉，剩下的是數據、社交和商業模式的組合戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">垂直副駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"24.【趨勢2023】從北森IPO看充滿挑戰的中國企服這兩年 PS NDR PMF fine tune pre-chain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-12-zhangxiaojun-企服公司2025年上市潮-先做后说-ps回到10倍以下/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8dd48df98352813c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0512</span></div>\n<h2>企服公司2025年上市潮：先做後說，PS回到10倍以下</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去兩三年整個企業服務市場被高估了50%到100%，PS從三四十倍回落到十倍以下。北森IPO是「丐版IPO」，但它是中國SaaS系統性上市的第一槍，2025年將有一波企服上市潮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業服務</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"22. 要做中國OpenAI？李志飛勸各位同仁冷靜點 self-supervised in-context learning AGI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-04-16-zhangxiaojun-李志飞劝退通用大模型-中国不会有第二个-openai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0bbf2eb9a18261c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0416</span></div>\n<h2>李志飛勸退通用大模型：中國不會有第二個 OpenAI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他一個月前說要當中國 OpenAI，現在說這個命題大概率不存在——因為共識達成太快、難度被開源和算力迅速拉低，而 OpenAI 自己能不能從商業上笑到最後都不好說。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"21. 投資人視角下的大模型和市場真實水溫｜和夢秋聊ChatGPT Killing App Prompt Engineering COT Fine tuning Middle layer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-04-08-zhangxiaojun-大模型是大厂的菜-创业公司别走-jasper-的老路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dff80d1dde94dc31-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0408</span></div>\n<h2>大模型是大廠的菜，創業公司別走 Jasper 的老路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型不是搜索引擎的替代品而是補充，真正的機會在醫療、材料這類大模型抓不到數據的垂直領域，而通用大模型本身只屬於巨頭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20. The Information前記者空降巴西，她的拉美商業遊記 warm intro growth VC fund Rappi Mafia The Edge of Democracy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-21-zhangxiaojun-巴西像七八年前的中国-但中间公司活不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23388c61192213d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0321</span></div>\n<h2>巴西像七八年前的中國，但中間公司活不下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴西的稅收和勞工法讓大公司和小團隊都能活，唯獨中間規模的公司被夾死；政治左右搖擺本身是確定的，創業者把它當成可控制的變量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"19. 硅谷銀行危機未結束：未來風險傳導的3個可能 FDIC MBS beginning of the end end of the beginning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-15-zhangxiaojun-硅谷银行倒闭-美联储只保存款人-不保股东/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46b66f8e0ad7b880-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">36:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0315</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷銀行倒閉：美聯儲只保存款人，不保股東</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美聯儲做了一個黑白分明的決定：三萬戶機構存款人全額保護，股東血本無歸。這不是雷曼時刻，而是一個時間差——但美國信譽的慢性下滑可能才剛開始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷銀行</span><span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"18. 商業口述史：從美國往事，到Google輸掉OpenAI第一局 money follows eyeball Transformer Alphabet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-14-zhangxiaojun-雅虎当年拒绝收购谷歌-因为不信搜索能做大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b956cb3f645c5229-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0314</span></div>\n<h2>雅虎當年拒絕收購谷歌，因為不信搜索能做大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雅虎和寶潔都犯過同一個錯：不相信搜索會走到前臺、不相信美國人會坐在街邊喝星巴克。創始人過早退到二線，公司就失去了賭一把的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商業口述史</span><span class=\"tag\">谷歌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"17.【趨勢2023】沉悶的港股會好嗎、富豪的家辦與苦惱 Family Office Trustee Boy Leverage Insurance PI客戶 Long Only\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-03-zhangxiaojun-家族办公室比家族还多-香港的财富管理时代才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a527783c09130bf7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0303</span></div>\n<h2>家族辦公室比家族還多，香港的財富管理時代才剛開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">港股從14000點反彈50%只是情緒修復，真正的新趨勢是香港從Fintech轉向Wealth Management——但家辦門檻低到沒有牌照要求，魚龍混雜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">港股</span><span class=\"tag\">家族辦公室</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"16.【趨勢2023】那些掙到錢、消失的互聯網中高層去哪了 Individual Contributor stakeholder social listening vintage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-02-16-zhangxiaojun-互联网中高层出走率接近三分之二-但这不是年龄问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd9c22e61c238c2f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0216</span></div>\n<h2>互聯網中高層出走率接近三分之二，但這不是年齡問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網二十年高增長靠技術紅利和用戶紅利，紅利掩蓋了管理能力的缺失；今天組織膨脹變成內耗，出走是行業自我校正，而不是35歲危機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互聯網</span><span class=\"tag\">職業經理人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"14. 香港的語言政策、曖昧和青年迷思 兩文三語 微調教學語言 吳慶瑞報告書 特選學校 Burlister liberal studies\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-31-zhangxiaojun-香港两文三语只有3-到5-的人能做到-这是个失败的政策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21c3ed4be09c6fe3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0131</span></div>\n<h2>香港兩文三語只有3%到5%的人能做到，這是個失敗的政策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香港堅持一個只有3%到5%的人能達到的語言政策目標，而新加坡用50年、三代人完成了從雙語並重到英文為主的轉向，代價是消滅方言和壓制反對派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港</span><span class=\"tag\">語言政策</span>\n</div></div></a>"]